    <!-- FAQ -->
    <string name="compendium_title">Guide</string>
    <string name="faq_what_q">What is this app for?</string>
    <string name="faq_what_a">It is a shelf of free content for Minecraft: add-ons, worlds, resource packs and skins. Pick one, take the file, and the game opens it.</string>
    <string name="faq_internet_q">Does it need the internet?</string>
    <string name="faq_internet_a">To look around and to take a file, yes. Once the file is on the phone, it goes into the game without any connection.</string>
    <string name="faq_how_q">How do I put a mod in the game?</string>
    <string name="faq_how_a">Open a mod, press Take the files, then Take it. When the file is on your phone, press Hand it to Minecraft — the game starts and imports it.</string>
    <string name="faq_fail_q">It would not install. Now what?</string>
    <string name="faq_fail_a">First make sure Minecraft is installed and up to date, then open the file again. If the file never finished arriving, take it once more — a half-saved file will not open.</string>
    <string name="faq_stuck_q">My download will not move.</string>
    <string name="faq_stuck_a">Nine times out of ten the provider is blocking the server the files sit on. Turn on a VPN and take the file again — that clears it almost every time.</string>
    <string name="faq_hidden_q">It is installed but missing in game.</string>
    <string name="faq_hidden_a">Open the settings of your world and switch the pack on there. A few mods also need the experimental toggles turned on in the same screen.</string>
    <string name="faq_lag_q">The game slowed down.</string>
    <string name="faq_lag_a">Heavy content asks a lot of a phone. Drop the render distance, or take the other packs out of the world and leave only the one you want.</string>
    <string name="faq_ads_q">Why do ads show up?</string>
    <string name="faq_ads_a">Advertising is what pays for the app, so the catalog can stay free for everyone.</string>
    <string name="faq_free_q">Is all of it free?</string>
    <string name="faq_free_a">Yes. Everything on the shelf can be taken and used without paying anything.</string>
    <string name="faq_fresh_q">How often does new stuff arrive?</string>
    <string name="faq_fresh_a">New content turns up on the shelf regularly — look into the Fresh order now and then.</string>
    <string name="faq_safe_q">Can this break my world?</string>
    <string name="faq_safe_a">They use the game\'s own file types, so nothing strange gets installed. Even so, make a copy of a world you care about before you add anything to it.</string>
